      "id": 11183,
      "name": "Captain Mime",
      "username": "Captain_Mime",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/captain_mime/{size}/2223_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-30T10:54:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is my first time ordering anything from Greater Than Games, so I'm not sure what to expect. I preordered Wrath of the Cosmos, put in all my information, and clicked \"Done\" (or something like that) at the end. But then I was taken back to the checkout screen, except all my information was gone! And the gift card I used to purchase the expansion still shows the same balance as it did before I ordered. So then I pressed the back button and pressed \"Done\" (or something like that) again, but it still took me back to checkout.</p><p>Will I get a confermation email? Will the money be taken from the card when the order ships? Will I be charged twice?&nbsp;Did something go wrong with the preorder? Should I contact someone? Is it too early&nbsp;in the morning to be asking so many questions?</p><p>Someone please let me know.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:25.853Z",
